	ShadowWidth, OpacityIntensity, DecodeShadowThreshold, DecodeSpecThreshold, SolidShadowProcess, \
	ShadowOffsetAdjustFactor, ShadowOffsetPower, MaskShadowOffsetStrength, SolidShadowWidth, \
	PBRRateIntensity, MetalEmissionStrength, MetalMatCapBack, MatCapInt, MetalMatCapInt, \
